{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T18:23:44+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tomb of The Lost Sentry", "steam_appid": 1480910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "After accidentally joining a cult, and quickly realizing their mistake, one cultist resolves to find a way out before they-to become another one of the countless victims of The Stronghold.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480910/extras/e167f77608abb5203b638ef591802af5.avif?t=1654865483\" width=640 height=90 /></span><br><br>There are a lot of locked doors between you and the nearest exit. Fortunately, most of them can be opened with good old-fashioned brain power.<br>Push blocks, manipulate sentrymen, redirect boulders, and do whatever else may be necessary to keep moving forward.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480910/extras/460b208457a3dd311879f221817df8b6.avif?t=1654865483\" width=640 height=180 /></span><br><br>The Stronghold isn't a safe place. With dart traps, loads of sawblades, and more spikes than any building should reasonably have, it's nothing short of a miracle that there are any cultists left.<br>Pay close attention to your surroundings to spot these traps, and you may make it out fully intact.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480910/extras/48d5755d2a847160ab176611e42059f0.avif?t=1654865483\" width=640 height=180 /></span><br><br>Some doors can't be opened with critical thinking alone. These ones require special keys held by the Higher-Ups. While it may seem straight-forward, getting these keys will be no easy task; But, it's the only way you'll have any chance of making it out of here alive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_im