ll be no easy task; But, it's the only way you'll have any chance of making it out of here alive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480910/extras/28d2d855785973a91c0497ccb68b68b9.avif?t=1654865483\" width=640 height=90 /></span><br><br>With nothing but your wits and your trusty dagger, can you survive long enough to find a way out? <br>Or will you be The Stronghold's next victim?", "short_description": "A 2D Puzzle/Platformer about escaping a cult. Pay close attention to your surroundings to spot deadly traps and solve puzzles. Face the Higher Ups to get their keys, and open new areas of the stronghold, all in the hopes of finding an exit.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480910/header.jpg?t=1654865483", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1654865483", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480910/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1654865483", "website": "https://spleengames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 and up.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> A potato<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Literally none<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> This game should be able to run on most devices.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> any, probably<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> a toaster<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> none<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Should be able to run on most devices.</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["spleeN"], "publishers": ["spleeN"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": f